    "type": "spec",
    "note": "The bundle withholds the reading and excerpt bytes. BUN-IMP-9 skips the payload bytes step and BUN-EXC-3 for them, so the import is ok. The device does not have the bytes, so an export with no permit withholds them (BUN-RED-5). The values come from the statements in the bundle."
